"<b>About</b>\n"
"An AppImage manager inspired by Gear Lever, but an independent project: it "
"shares neither its code, its name nor its icon.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Built with</b>\n"
"Rust, GTK 4, libadwaita, Relm4, backhand and ureq."
